For the lower, use recurrent colors in the all-size actual contracting families as in Lemma 10.2. For unit vectors with angle $\theta$, the minimum radius of a ball containing $0,u,v$ is

$$
\begin{cases}
1/(2\cos(\theta/2)),&0\le\theta\le\pi/2,\\
